Third-party material bundled with Nipret (luci-app-nikki-unblock)
=================================================================

luci-app-nikki-unblock/root/usr/share/nikki-unblock/game_udp.bin

    A captured game-protocol handshake datagram, used as the decoy payload of
    the games profile's UDP fake. Taken verbatim (as bin/ACTIVE_GAME_UDP.bin)
    from the zapret-discord-youtube project:

        https://github.com/Flowseal/zapret-discord-youtube

    It is bundled rather than generated because the content is what makes it
    work: zapret2's own quic_initial_* blobs, and a synthetic QUIC-shaped
    datagram of the same length, both leave the game server silent.

